            in: 'query',
            name: 'transformations[0]',
            schema: { type: 'array', items: { type: 'string' } },
            description:
              'Ordered transformations for a zero-based `yAxis` position. Replace `0` with the target axis index.\nRepeat the indexed key for each operation, for example\n`transformations[0]=fill(locf)&transformations[0]=smooth(sma,3)`.\nEach axis accepts at most one fill and one smooth operation, in execution order.\nFill modes are `locf`, `zero`, and `linear`. Smoothing modes are `sma`, `ema`, and `asap`.\nOmit the indexed key to leave that axis unchanged. Requires the interpolation and smoothing feature.',
